# Annotator workbooks — regenerable from the programme, the snapshot and the seed
# (`iris sample <pdf> -o …`), so the seed and fingerprint are the record, not 130 KB
# of derived CSV. The *completed* workbooks are a different artefact and belong with
# the Sprint 4 evaluation results.
04-implementation/annotation/workbooks/
